<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20650" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hĭempsal</span></b> ,
		ălis, m.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Son of Micipsa and king of Numidia</i>, <i><span class="en">Sall. J. 5,
				7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">11, 3</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Flor.
				3, 8, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Suet. Caes.
			71</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Another king of Numidia</i>, perh. <i>son of the former</i>, <i><span class="en">Sall. J.
			17</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A king of Mauritania</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic.
				Vatin. 5, 12 al.</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
